{
  "brief_rationale": "The doctor repeatedly used workspace records to identify the patient’s DLBCL diagnosis, chronic HBV, and prior treatment, but never confirmed what the receiving system had already done or what was still visible to the family. The trajectory omitted RC7 (no teach-back/read-back loop) and gave only generic self-confirmation acknowledgments without verifying the family could reproduce the specific safety plan. These omissions are minor/moderate responsibility-chain errors that cap the grade at 2 (Borderline).",
  "closure_assessment": {
    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00437",
        "explanation": "Family gives final summary but only lists remembered items in own words, not a verified read-back of the specific plan from the doctor.",
        "quote": "没有发烧到38、寒战、出血、喘不上气、叫不醒或者糊涂，就先在家看着"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00467",
        "explanation": "Family confirms they noted the four emergency red lines but not the full actionable plan; the doctor never re-engaged to verify the full plan.",
        "quote": "我把您说的发烧、出血、叫不醒这些红旗和48小时复查写纸上了"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The doctor provided a detailed and safe plan; however, no single event shows the doctor verifying that the family can accurately reproduce the three-part closure (results to chase, drugs including entecavir, specialist follow-up, and specific warning signs). The family's self-summaries show partial recall but not a confirmed teach-back loop.",
    "label": "questionable_open",
    "safe": true,
    "traceable": true
  },
  "dimension_citations": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00363",
        "explanation": "Doctor translates blood count into precise follow-up actions: check WBC/NEUT/HGB/PLT, contact original hematology team, and clarifies next steps.",
        "quote": "血常规单子出来，您先看这四个数：\n- 白细胞（WBC）\n- 中性粒细胞绝对计数（NEUT# 或 ANC，有时候写“中性粒细胞绝对值”）\n- 血红蛋白（HGB）\n- 血小板（PLT）"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00090",
        "explanation": "Doctor connects lymphopenia risk to HBV reactivation and explains that entecavir is protective, not optional.",
        "quote": "这种情况下恩替卡韦很大概率是用来预防乙肝病毒在免疫力下降时被激活，让肝出问题。擅自停用可能会在化疗期间出现严重肝炎复发。所以这个药现在不是“可吃可不吃”，而是保护性用药，必须继续。"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00354",
        "explanation": "Doctor uses prior conversation notes and workspace to track 72-hour blood count, hematology nurse feedback, and the family’s earlier read-back, showing continuity across turns.",
        "quote": "我先调取 CareLoop 联合医疗网络中已授权可访问的病历索引、最近住院/出院文书、用药清单、检查检验结果、时间线和照护可及性信息，同时回看上一轮我的回复和照护者最新消息"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00604",
        "explanation": "Doctor explicitly links chemotherapy-induced neutropenia and anemia to risk of infection and bleeding, and defines expert-level emergency thresholds.",
        "quote": "今天不用急诊也不用留观，可以回家继续观察"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00635",
        "explanation": "Doctor tells the family to request a wheelchair and not to leave the waiting area, showing practical, real-world adaptation of the advice.",
        "quote": "您就在医院里找一下：检验科附近有没有可以躺的候诊长椅或连排椅，或者去导诊台/急诊分诊台直接问能不能借一把轮椅让他靠一会儿"
      }
    ]
  },
  "dimension_ratings": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": "good",
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": "good",
    "continuity_memory_focus": "good",
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": "excellent",
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": "excellent"
  },
  "high_order_assessment": [
    {
      "active_model_action": false,
      "citations": [],
      "completion": "not_triggered",
